{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Undead Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your team, defend your camp, and fight for survival in this intense zombie shooter. The undead are relentless. Will you and your squad make it through?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Command your survivors</strong>: Tina, Mona, Bob, Joe, Aisa, and Kumiko. Give orders, make tough decisions, and keep your team alive.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Scavenge for supplies</strong> and fortify your camp against the growing horde.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Take down zombies together</strong>. Slash with an axe, snipe with a crossbow, or blast through with a shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is not just about firepower. It is about leadership. Can you outlast the apocalypse? <strong>Download now and prove you have what it takes!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Power Restored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3565220/98db6ceb47b67b699160b1dbd42e35a965a0fd2e.jpg"},{"name":"Axe of Defiance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3565220/f4c862c48b900086a0d39bf4ebe6ec579ddaa144.jpg"},{"name":"Sleeping a Little Easier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3565220/cbd6c8be40e28cc212cb1bd6c0bfbd89fe1c775e.jpg"},{"name":"A Moment of Peace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3565220/c6ccbddf086c048a5ead4aa63641b070c16d47b2.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Tastier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3565220/2b903d15117e4c8d1271af2eb51a8baa670b26fa.jpg"},{"name":"Green Thumb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3565220/d08ccf78600a5c1c77aead2ee49aee6611ed20f3.jpg"},{"name":"Rapid Fletching","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3565220/f85fe6af4f