fend your camp, and fight for survival in this intense zombie shooter. The undead are relentless. Will you and your squad make it through?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Command your survivors</strong>: Tina, Mona, Bob, Joe, Aisa, and Kumiko. Give orders, make tough decisions, and keep your team alive.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Scavenge for supplies</strong> and fortify your camp against the growing horde.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Take down zombies together</strong>. Slash with an axe, snipe with a crossbow, or blast through with a shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is not just about firepower. It is about leadership. Can you outlast the apocalypse? <strong>Download now and prove you have what it takes!</strong></p>","developers":["Uygar Bursal\u0131o\u011flu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565220/da24272eac5e81938839d5ea170ee7dd5eafe168/header.jpg?t=1766534783","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3565220/920618510/cd0d922d8001450e8c63fea706bf7673f6b2ad94/1766533380/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766534783","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3565220/920618510/cd0d922d8001450e8c63fea706bf7673f6b2ad94/1766533380/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766534783","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3565220/920618510/cd0d922d8001450e8c63fea706bf7673f6b2ad94/1766533380/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766534783","id":257216053,"name":"Gameplay Overview","thumbnail":"https://s